### SECTION 4. PAYMENT SECURITY & PCI-DSS COMPLIANCE
The Software is architected exclusively around client-side tokenization and hosted payment gateways (Paystack, Flutterwave, Stripe, PayPal). The Software does not capture or store raw cardholder Primary Account Numbers (PAN), CVVs, or banking PINs. Client maintains sole accountability for securing merchant API keys, configuring webhook signatures, and ensuring compliance with PCI-DSS guidelines.

